{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人伍禮賢於節目中推介中芯國際(981)，指選股策略回歸與大市氣氛有關板塊。基本面上，大模型算力需求仍供不應求，令全球半導體產業鏈訂單的能見度高企，公司產品均價亦穩步上行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026GdgzFXz7a41790057288.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">伍禮賢建議現價即65.45元買入，目標價上望72元，若失守60美元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中芯國際(981)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：現價→$65.45</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$72</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$60</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Zmiv5RzaR21790057300.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人黃敏碩推介信達生物(1801)，一來市傳美國擬放行藥企與中國的新藥授權交易，利好短期氣氛，其次市場上的減肥藥即將踏入收成期，公司另外與輝瑞達成戰略合作協議，都有助公司未來營收增長。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026OnX84sFjxI1790057275.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃敏碩建議現價即103.4元便可買入，目標價看112元，止蝕價定於93.5元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">信達生物(1801)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：現價→$103.4</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$112</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$93.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026oq84f4ygPF1790057330.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T08:09:36.608549+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":353,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}